<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41563" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίφρων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, gen.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ονος</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
			ʽφρήν̓</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thoughtful,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἵ τε δύνανται ἄφρονα
				ποιῆσαι..ἐπίφρονα</span> to make <i>the thoughtful</i>
			thoughtless, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				23.12
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰχμητὴν..καὶ ἐπίφρονα βουλήν</span>
			<i>sage</i> in counsel, <i><span class="en">
				16.242
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. Αὐγείαο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					25.29
				</span></i>
			 ; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. βουλή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					3.128
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				122
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. μῆτις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					19.326
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				B.
				15.25
			</span></i>. —
				Ep.
			 and Lyr., never in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
			</span></i></div>
